Z||000000||Alex2004||02-07-2001||07:40 PM||||I was just wondering if any one has seen a pic of an airbag on a Fiero, or had ABS installed on it.  I think it would be kinda cool to have a Drivers Airbag out of a Grand Am or something, do any of you know how much that would cost to do that? or how much it would cost to have ABS installed.  I wasn't really planning on doing this but, think it would be a neat idea for a Fiero.  lmk...<BR>thanks<P>Alex...||||reg||4
Z||000001||Oreif||02-07-2001||08:38 PM||||Unless you want to make custom spindles you cannot get ABS. As for Airbags you would need to find a donor column. My only question is "Why?"||||reg||1
